// The slice overrides the module's vessel with one looked up by the query's own key; the type stays Vessel.
// The Vessel read model is the one the VesselList slice builds.
feature VesselDetails
  slice StateView VesselDetail
    provide vessel Vessel optional from query VesselByKey by $context.arguments.vesselId

    query VesselByKey => Vessel optional
      by vesselId Uuid
